	(embedded_fonts no)
	(text "USB ESD: U9 I/O2 pins 3/4 = DP; I/O1 pins 1/6 = DM. USB polarity at U2/J1 is unchanged.\nMain pair on F.Cu; the duplicated Type-C B7 contact uses a short B.Cu branch.\n90-ohm impedance and both-orientation HS/ESD tests remain pending. See USB_ROUTING_REPAIR_CN.md."
		(at 38.1 345.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "01bd0f66-c13e-51aa-9543-41f82003ec50")
	)
	(text "TF POWER: R20 10k to GND; R21 100R. PH12 / SD_PWR_EN: LOW or Hi-Z = ON, HIGH = OFF.\n3V3 must be valid before boot. Card detection / cold-start waveforms still require hardware validation."
		(at 38.1 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2cabf495-88b5-5dda-bae8-d355c93baeb7")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY GPIO: PA8 (U2.66) -> LCD_RST; PA9 / EINT9 (U2.65) <- LCD_TE. Both use 1V8.\nR32 10k holds reset LOW at boot. R29 must remain fitted 0R; VDDIO must share the PA supply.\nUpdate firmware pin assignments; PD19 / PD20 are now unconnected. See DISPLAY_IO_REPAIR_CN.md."
		(at 38.1 358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
